WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.064 --> 00:00:15.650
When woke up the next morning, the rain had stopped.

2
00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.691
He jumped out of bed, hoping to see Geppetto.

3
00:00:19.371 --> 00:00:20.992
But he saw only the Blue Fairy.

4
00:00:21.012 --> 00:00:23.813
"Do you want to become a real boy?"

5
00:00:24.193 --> 00:00:24.713
she asked.

6
00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:27.574
"Yes!" said Pinocchio excitedly.

7
00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:30.495
"Do you want to save Geppetto?"

8
00:00:30.996 --> 00:00:31.516
she asked.

9
00:00:32.392 --> 00:00:33.073
"Oh yes!"

10
00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:34.273
said Pinocchio.

11
00:00:34.293 --> 00:00:36.354
"Then listen carefully.

12
00:00:37.295 --> 00:00:40.857
To become a real boy, you must obey your father.

13
00:00:41.837 --> 00:00:43.818
But first, you must save him.

14
00:00:44.739 --> 00:00:46.860
You will save him by honoring him."

15
00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.221
"I don't understand.

16
00:00:49.902 --> 00:00:52.283
How can I honor him if he is not here?"

17
00:00:52.783 --> 00:00:54.524
Pinocchio asked, confused.

18
00:00:55.145 --> 00:00:56.825
"You must honor his wishes.

19
00:00:57.866 --> 00:00:59.827
What did Geppetto want you to do?"

20
00:01:00.247 --> 00:01:01.168
asked the Blue Fairy.

21
00:01:02.112 --> 00:01:04.833
"He wanted me to go to school," he said.

22
00:01:04.853 --> 00:01:07.334
"Then you must go to school.

23
00:01:08.135 --> 00:01:11.056
You may live with me and study in the village.

24
00:01:12.096 --> 00:01:15.918
Once you honor him, you can save him," she said.

25
00:01:16.738 --> 00:01:18.259
Pinocchio was sad to hear this.

26
00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:21.940
He did not want to go to school.

27
00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:25.882
But, he wanted to save his father so he agreed to go.

28
00:01:28.923 --> 00:01:31.164
Pinocchio became the best student in the school.

29
00:01:32.116 --> 00:01:33.817
His teacher was very happy with him.

30
00:01:34.597 --> 00:01:37.159
However, some of the students were mean to Pinocchio.

31
00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:41.901
One day after school, some of the boys followed him home.

32
00:01:41.921 --> 00:01:44.983
"How can a wooden head become smart?"

33
00:01:45.563 --> 00:01:46.364
one boy asked.

34
00:01:46.384 --> 00:01:48.805
"Use it as a bookend!"

35
00:01:49.125 --> 00:01:49.805
the other said.

36
00:01:50.346 --> 00:01:51.246
All the boys laughed.

37
00:01:51.266 --> 00:01:55.388
"What will Pinocchio be when he grows up?"

38
00:01:55.989 --> 00:01:57.369
the first boy asked the others.

39
00:01:57.389 --> 00:02:00.451
"A little wooden boy!"

40
00:02:01.232 --> 00:02:01.852
they answered.

41
00:02:02.228 --> 00:02:04.509
And they laughed again.

42
00:02:04.529 --> 00:02:08.231
"I'm smart, and one day, I will be a real boy!"

43
00:02:08.732 --> 00:02:09.492
said Pinocchio.

44
00:02:09.512 --> 00:02:11.253
"Oh yeah?

45
00:02:11.633 --> 00:02:17.036
Well, if you prove you are smart now, you can be a real boy today," one boy said.

46
00:02:17.056 --> 00:02:19.217
"What do you mean?"

47
00:02:19.858 --> 00:02:20.658
asked Pinocchio.

48
00:02:20.678 --> 00:02:27.242
"Well, if you do what real boys do, that would make you a real boy, right?"

49
00:02:27.762 --> 00:02:28.302
he asked.

50
00:02:29.503 --> 00:02:32.652
"Well, I guess so," said Pinocchio.

51
00:02:32.672 --> 00:02:39.854
"And if I were a real boy, then I could save Father faster," he thought to himself.

52
00:02:39.874 --> 00:02:42.775
"I can do anything you can do!"

53
00:02:43.355 --> 00:02:44.116
said Pinocchio.

54
00:02:44.136 --> 00:02:47.296
"I'll show you I can be a real boy."

55
00:02:47.316 --> 00:02:48.977
"Oh yeah?

56
00:02:49.277 --> 00:02:51.918
Well, today, we are running away to Paradisle.

57
00:02:52.498 --> 00:02:56.239
If you're a real boy, you'll come with us," one boy said.

58
00:02:56.259 --> 00:02:58.380
"What is Paradisle?"

59
00:02:58.860 --> 00:02:59.760
Pinocchio asked.

60
00:03:01.224 --> 00:03:04.366
"It's an island where real boys play all day.

61
00:03:04.806 --> 00:03:06.267
They never have to do work.

62
00:03:06.727 --> 00:03:08.688
They eat dessert for every meal.

63
00:03:09.249 --> 00:03:10.709
And everyone is rich."

64
00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:13.671
This sounded great to Pinocchio.

65
00:03:14.211 --> 00:03:16.293
So he followed the boys to the end of the village.

66
00:03:16.973 --> 00:03:19.534
There, they met a man with a wagon full of boys.

67
00:03:20.235 --> 00:03:23.477
The wagon was pulled by very sad donkeys wearing clothes.

68
00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:25.518
But the boys didn't notice them.

69
00:03:26.218 --> 00:03:29.040
They jumped into the wagon and rode to the end of the island.

70
00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:33.660
"Here we are, boys!"

71
00:03:34.241 --> 00:03:35.301
called the wagon master.

72
00:03:35.321 --> 00:03:42.623
"This ferry goes to Paradisle, where every day is a holiday, and you never have to work.

73
00:03:43.303 --> 00:03:45.964
Come quickly, before the ferry is full!"

74
00:03:47.564 --> 00:03:49.845
Pinocchio and the boys ran to the ferry.

75
00:03:50.485 --> 00:03:53.806
Pinocchio noticed there were a lot of donkeys coming off the ferry.

76
00:03:54.366 --> 00:03:56.046
But he didn't stop to wonder why.

77
00:03:56.887 --> 00:03:58.367
He wanted to be a real boy.

78
00:03:58.907 --> 00:04:00.408
And he wanted to save his father.

79
00:04:01.268 --> 00:04:04.835
At Paradisle, he could do both and he wouldn't have to work!
